<title>BAHRAIN: National Bank of Bahrain H1 97 net rises.</title>
<headline>National Bank of Bahrain H1 97 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MANAMA 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million Bahraini dinars)</p>
<p> Net profit		 8.8   vs     7.4</p>
<p> Operating income	14.0   vs    13.8</p>
<p> Operating expenses     5.9   vs     5.5</p>
<p> Shareholders' funds  101.6   vs    97.4</p>
<p> Assets		   851.6   vs   823.2</p>
<p>Full Name: National Bank of Bahrain.</p>
<p>Note - The bank is the biggest commercial bank on the island and is traded on the Bahrain Stock Exchange. -- Bahrain newsroom 973-524424</p>
</text>
